    Melodix design tokens - SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for native shell metrics.

    Every native shell dimension resolves through this file. The tablet variant
    res/values-sw600dp/mel_dimens.xml overrides the same names, which is how the
    tablet gets a genuinely different layout instead of a stretched phone:
    gutters, touch targets, artwork, typography and shelf cards each have their
    own tablet value.

    The phone values below are the historical literals, so introducing the
    tokens changed no phone rendering. Visual refinement is a separate step.

    Rules:
      * never hardcode a shell dimension in a layout again;
      * never override a token for one screen only - add a new role instead;
      * colour lives in colors.xml (mel_*), never here.
-->
